    <briefdescription>
<para>Identifies one node that participates in a coordinated update. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Nodes are updated strictly in ascending sequence_number order. The replication leader (highest sequence_number, or the node explicitly marked is_leader) is updated last to preserve replication safety. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
